The user will ask something like: "I want to file my 2023 taxes correctly. I'm married filing jointly in Portland OR. W-2 from Desert Sun Logistics: $84,900. Additional income: $11,200 (web design, 2 clients), $920 from Goldman Sachs M..."

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


